<p><a id="APH"></a>&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="21290723"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/b4202b458bc945dd8f45f9cafec14a35/noorderplaats_0.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/b4202b458bc945dd8f45f9cafec14a35/noorderplaats_0.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/b4202b458bc945dd8f45f9cafec14a35/noorderplaats_0.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/b4202b458bc945dd8f45f9cafec14a35/noorderplaats_0.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Artesis Plantijn Hogeschool</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.ap.be/english">Artesis Plantijn Hogeschool</a> er en høyskole i Antwerpen, med et godt utvalg av kommunikasjonsrelaterte fag. Royal Academy Antwerp er også en del av AP. De tilbyr flere relevante utvekslingsprogram, som European Project Semester, International Class Graphic and Digital Media, og Royal Academy Antwerps utvekslingsprogram innnen grafisk design.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="/contentassets/b4202b458bc945dd8f45f9cafec14a35/2026-2027_ap_factsheet-1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact sheet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ap.be/en/international/practical-information">Praktisk informasjon</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ap.be/en/exchange-students" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ap.be/en/exchange-students" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Studentlivet i Antwerp</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ap.be/en/ap-dna" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Universitetets strategi</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Artesis er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - januar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra januar/februar - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['21290723-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/b4202b458bc945dd8f45f9cafec14a35/noorderplaats_0.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Artesis Plantijn Hogeschool","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.ap.be/english\">Artesis Plantijn Hogeschool</a> er en h&oslash;yskole i Antwerpen, med et godt utvalg av kommunikasjonsrelaterte fag. Royal Academy Antwerp er ogs&aring; en del av AP. De tilbyr flere relevante utvekslingsprogram, som European Project Semester, International Class Graphic and Digital Media, og Royal Academy Antwerps utvekslingsprogram innnen grafisk design.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/b4202b458bc945dd8f45f9cafec14a35/2026-2027_ap_factsheet-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ap.be/en/international/practical-information\">Praktisk informasjon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ap.be/en/exchange-students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ap.be/en/exchange-students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studentlivet i Antwerp</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ap.be/en/ap-dna\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Universitetets strategi</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Artesis er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september - januar<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra januar/februar - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="artevelde"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="b1c0acb4"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/ae8c896cb98647019b7444910b7b1f95/oip.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/ae8c896cb98647019b7444910b7b1f95/oip.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/ae8c896cb98647019b7444910b7b1f95/oip.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/ae8c896cb98647019b7444910b7b1f95/oip.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Artevelde Hogeschool</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Artevelde Hogeschool</a> er et universitet med beliggenhet i Gent, Belgia. Det er et katolsk universitet med mange undervisninger som foregår på engelsk. Samtidig som byen er en porteby er det i tillegg ansett som en universitetsby, med mange studenter beboende der.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/about-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/enrolment/enrolling-exchange-student" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Programside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/about-us/dna-artevelde-uas" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/studying-artevelde-university-applied-sciences/starting-your-studies/student-life-ghent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Studentlivet i Gent</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/ae8c896cb98647019b7444910b7b1f95/abs_fact-sheet_ay2627.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact sheet</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som følger<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - januar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['b1c0acb4-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/ae8c896cb98647019b7444910b7b1f95/oip.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Artevelde Hogeschool","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Artevelde Hogeschool</a> er et universitet med beliggenhet i Gent, Belgia. Det er et katolsk universitet med mange undervisninger som foreg&aring;r p&aring; engelsk. Samtidig som byen er en porteby er det i tillegg ansett som en universitetsby, med mange studenter beboende der.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/about-us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/enrolment/enrolling-exchange-student\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Programside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/about-us/dna-artevelde-uas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.arteveldehogeschool.be/en/studying-artevelde-university-applied-sciences/starting-your-studies/student-life-ghent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studentlivet i Gent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/ae8c896cb98647019b7444910b7b1f95/abs_fact-sheet_ay2627.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact sheet</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som f&oslash;lger<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september - januar<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="Hasselt"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="023c722e"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/b119891b7f0d4df2a69f5604fee6dc29/header-feiten-en-cijfers.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/b119891b7f0d4df2a69f5604fee6dc29/header-feiten-en-cijfers.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/b119891b7f0d4df2a69f5604fee6dc29/header-feiten-en-cijfers.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/b119891b7f0d4df2a69f5604fee6dc29/header-feiten-en-cijfers.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Hasselt University</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.uhasselt.be/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hasselt University</a> er et innovativt universitet med en internasjonal orientering. Selve campuset ligger sentralt i byen Hasselt, med kort avstand til hovedstaden Brussel.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="/contentassets/b119891b7f0d4df2a69f5604fee6dc29/infosheet-uhasselt_tul-2026-2027-042026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact Sheet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9G75NQzZCZM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reklamefilm</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.uhasselt.be/en/international/study-uhasselt/exchange-students" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Praktisk informasjon</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.uhasselt.be/en/international" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.uhasselt.be/en/about-hasselt-university" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Hasselt er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - januar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['023c722e-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/b119891b7f0d4df2a69f5604fee6dc29/header-feiten-en-cijfers.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Hasselt University","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.uhasselt.be/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hasselt University</a> er et innovativt universitet med en internasjonal orientering. Selve campuset ligger sentralt i byen Hasselt, med kort avstand til hovedstaden Brussel.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/b119891b7f0d4df2a69f5604fee6dc29/infosheet-uhasselt_tul-2026-2027-042026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact Sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9G75NQzZCZM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reklamefilm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uhasselt.be/en/international/study-uhasselt/exchange-students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Praktisk informasjon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uhasselt.be/en/international\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uhasselt.be/en/about-hasselt-university\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Hasselt er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september - januar<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="Gent"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="d9c50aae"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/bc94db2a545945259a41cd8408bf57db/last-ned.jpeg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/bc94db2a545945259a41cd8408bf57db/last-ned.jpeg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/bc94db2a545945259a41cd8408bf57db/last-ned.jpeg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/bc94db2a545945259a41cd8408bf57db/last-ned.jpeg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Hogeschool Gent</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.hogent.be/en/">Hogeschool Gent</a> ligger i middelalderbyen Gent, omlag 50 km nordvest for Brussel. Gent er en studentby med rundt 65 000 studenter, og ligger i Flandern, den nederlandsk-talende delen av Belgia.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.hogent.be/en/about-us/">Informasjon om universitetet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hogent.be/en/city-of-ghent/">Informasjon om byen, Gent</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hogent.be/en/future-student/exchange-programmes/what-is-an-exchange-student/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Informasjon om emner</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hogent.be/en/student/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Informasjon for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/bc94db2a545945259a41cd8408bf57db/hogent_arrival_guide_2025_binnenwerk_wire-o_100x140_web.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">International student guide brosjyre</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQwM014jAiI" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reklamefilm</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Hogeschool Gent er som følger:<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - januar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['d9c50aae-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/bc94db2a545945259a41cd8408bf57db/last-ned.jpeg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Hogeschool Gent","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.hogent.be/en/\">Hogeschool Gent</a> ligger i middelalderbyen Gent, omlag 50 km nordvest for Brussel. Gent er en studentby med rundt 65 000 studenter, og ligger i Flandern, den nederlandsk-talende delen av Belgia.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hogent.be/en/about-us/\">Informasjon om universitetet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hogent.be/en/city-of-ghent/\">Informasjon om byen, Gent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hogent.be/en/future-student/exchange-programmes/what-is-an-exchange-student/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Informasjon om emner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hogent.be/en/student/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Informasjon for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/bc94db2a545945259a41cd8408bf57db/hogent_arrival_guide_2025_binnenwerk_wire-o_100x140_web.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">International student guide brosjyre</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQwM014jAiI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reklamefilm</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Hogeschool Gent er som f&oslash;lger:<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september - januar<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
