<div id="41bae9da"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/52410826113_c8cd652ca6_6k.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/52410826113_c8cd652ca6_6k.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/52410826113_c8cd652ca6_6k.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/52410826113_c8cd652ca6_6k.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Howest University</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.howest.be/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Howest University of Applied Sciences</a> er et moderne og fremtidsrettet universitet i Belgia. Universitetet har campus i Brugge og Kortrijk. Universitetet tilbyr relevante emner innen blant annet digitale medier, forretning, og kunst for Kristiania studenter.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="/contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/howest-information-sheet-2025-2026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact sheet</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/howest_uas_brochure_en_2025-26.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Howest brosjyre</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.howest.be/en/vision-mission-and-values" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.howest.be/en/study-programmes?f%5B0%5D=programme-type%3A27&amp;f%5B1%5D=studylanguage%3A52" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Engelske semesterprogram</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.howest.be/en/incoming-international-students" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside kommende studenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://youtu.be/Ct5liJZmppk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reklamefilm</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Howest University er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - januar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['41bae9da-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/52410826113_c8cd652ca6_6k.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Howest University","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.howest.be/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Howest University of Applied Sciences</a> er et moderne og fremtidsrettet universitet i Belgia. Universitetet har campus i Brugge og Kortrijk. Universitetet tilbyr relevante emner innen blant annet digitale medier, forretning, og kunst for Kristiania studenter.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/howest-information-sheet-2025-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/5f36e9e9c6b3485899c973f0ee7d97d9/howest_uas_brochure_en_2025-26.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Howest brosjyre</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.howest.be/en/vision-mission-and-values\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.howest.be/en/study-programmes?f%5B0%5D=programme-type%3A27&amp;f%5B1%5D=studylanguage%3A52\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Engelske semesterprogram</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.howest.be/en/incoming-international-students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside kommende studenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Ct5liJZmppk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reklamefilm</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Howest University er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september - januar<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
